## Scope (deferred from Phase 36 CONTEXT.md "Noted for Later")

- Phase 37 (proposed): Compose UI / New Message Button + Compose Window (Thunderbird-style)
- Phase 38 (proposed): Reply / Reply-All UI/UX when a message is open
